        {
          "id": "d02-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q2 2025, management expects a return to hiring in engineering and customer success. Capital expenditure for Q2 2025 is budgeted at $7.7M, the majority allocated to laboratory equipment.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
